I completely understand the requirements and the bug you encountered.
The bug where **"all items are selected at once"** happened because the database returns the uppercase key ID, but the React code was checking for the lowercase row.id. Since both were undefined, React thought every single row was selected!
Here are the exact replacements to fix the bug, add the new column with formatted dates, and update the UI perfectly.
